lines+=['','Mesh CD uses2048 area-sampled mesh points vs8192 source points, unsquared symmetric mean/2; original paper uses a different render/depth sampling protocol. All-case empty-mesh penalty sqrt(3), unit-box diameter. Paired GT-bone skin rows use identical SHA-seeded512 point queries. No generated-topology skin accuracy is claimed.','','## Strict single-image generation','', 'These cases read only one image condition and noise at runtime. All empty/budget failures are retained. Main objective is standard MSE; foreground-balanced loss is an explicitly changed diagnostic, not a paper result.','', '| Path | Nonempty meshes /30 | Surface IoU | Rig IoU | All-case mesh CD×100 | Cap hits / decoded |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
for g in generations:lines.append(f"| {g['label']} | {g['nonempty']}/30 | {fmt(g['metrics']['surface_iou'],1)} | {fmt(g['metrics']['rig_iou'],1)} | {fmt(g['metrics']['chamfer_all_empty_penalty'])} | {g['cap_hits']}/{g['decoded']} |")
